  "excerpt": "A mango and coconut cake pairs a coconut sponge with a ripe mango filling and a coconut cream cheese frosting. The mango filling is made from fresh or frozen mango blitzed with a little lime juice, it is deliberately fruit-forward and sharp, cutting through the sweetness of the frosting. A scattering of toasted coconut flakes on the outside gives texture and signals the flavour.",
