        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Mango and coconut cake has a coconut sponge that is richer and slightly denser than a plain butter sponge, a sharp mango filling with lime juice, and a coconut cream cheese frosting. The combination needs the sharpness of the mango filling to balance the sweetness of the frosting, don't reduce the lime juice."
